", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JyeZG268WeYQ7kNvwE6AkOk&_nc_oc=AdqxTC4PoobYgh8WzpGUxZ_v-Hj7V_PY5HdPyIiRwbYxtmiXWL8ORzDqk-KQFwaSpdo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1-HUYZg2vPTumO7s90MR8xVtu0YNPXtm5YIe2WzNmCjA&oe=69DF94F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X0xKh9B4C3IQ7kNvwGpaI3J&_nc_oc=AdoODbD94i57qGB9069Dltvtn1guncAp2QRPBCNzRi7etU1-D3K0QjFL38VCWV61jSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2r8ugLvMxYla2_U2seecsg1S_h4-xWiNs18-nA4usNPA&oe=69DF738B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fhAhyMRT2esQ7kNvwElKlB7&_nc_oc=AdrzebG_UyN6MLtmoQ55slmnGxu1rbFE8YcGrqAmRRrw9pVfSZABfu608koixQcxlWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3HvoYddubUZUf5QQTl4QnvUmnxK7OJtUq2wYG6y-jv_A&oe=69DF720E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel